    "title": "Kavanaugh exposes the fatal flaw in drawing asylum lines the government will simply sidestep - Whatfinger News Quick Hits",
    "text": "Justice Brett Kavanaugh cut straight to the core problem Tuesday during oral arguments in Noem v. Al Otro Lado: any line the Supreme Court draws on where asylum seekers can be turned away, the federal government will just enforce a few feet beyond it.\nThe observation landed like a brick on the theoretical scaffolding built by immigrant rights advocates. Kavanaugh pressed their attorney repeatedly on where exactly the boundary should fall on the southern side of the U.S.-Mexico border. His conclusion was blunt.\nRead Full Article: https://conservativeinstitute.org/justice/kavanaugh-exposes-the-fatal-flaw-in-drawing-asylum-lines-the-government-will-simply-sidestep.htm",
